message: "If you use these skills in work you cite, cite this repository."
title: a11y-skills
abstract: >-
  Thirty WCAG 2.2 procedures for coding agents. Each skill is a procedure with a
  verification step and a named failure-mode list, every success-criterion
  citation is checked against the spec, and the fixes that can be decided in a
  DOM are proved by executable axe-core fixtures.
